# Never commit real patient/subject data. Any data-shaped file is ignored by
# default — including the formats this tool reads and the ones researchers keep
# alongside them — and only the two synthetic example files are allowed back in
# by name (a blanket "!examples/*.csv" would let a real export dropped into
# examples/ sail straight into the repository).
*.[Cc][Ss][Vv]*
*.[Tt][Ss][Vv]*
*.[Xx][Ll][Ss]*
*.txt
*.sav
*.dta
*.parquet
*.json
*.sqlite*
*.zip
*.pdf
*.svg
*.docx
~$*

!examples/sleep_diary_trial.csv
!examples/수면일기_한글_cp949.csv
